The idea of this trip was super spontaneous (just like all the best things in life).

On a random evening, I hop on a call with Rohit - we discuss summer plans. Rohit tells me he wanted to do a cross-country Canada Tour.

I was immediately sold!

Are we joking - Sahaj Tour + Visiting Canada!!!

Since I went to the DEVI School as a student, it's been a long-time dream to see the country, from coast to coast ❤️.

Rohit, Luke, Priya & Anant - picked me up from Halifax.

We went to eat some sushi + setup the bike rack for the Outback Subaru!

Super nostalgic being back at the DEVI School. Super happy and blessed to be there, once again.

